max-w-4xl mx-auto"><h2 id=3D"format-selection" class=3D"font-times text-4xl=
 md:text-5xl font-black text-gray-900 tracking-tighter mb-6">Format Selecti=
on</h2><p class=3D"text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-10">Format is t=
he highest-leverage decision in image optimization. Two images at identical=
 visual quality can differ by 80% in file size purely because of format cho=
ice. Get this right before you touch anything else.</p><div class=3D"grid m=
d:grid-cols-2 gap-8 my-12"><div class=3D"bg-gray-50 border-l-4 border-green=
-500 p-6"><h3 class=3D"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">WebP</h3><p c=
lass=3D"text-gray-700">The default choice for web images. Lossy and lossles=
s modes, alpha channel support, and universal browser coverage. If you're n=
ot using WebP, you're over-serving every visitor.</p></div><div class=3D"bg=
-gray-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-6"><h3 class=3D"text-2xl font-bold te=
xt-gray-900 mb-4">AVIF</h3><p class=3D"text-gray-700">Better compression th=
an WebP, especially at low quality settings. Encode times are slower=E2=80=
=94worth it for high-traffic pages where the file will be downloaded millio=
ns of times.</p></div><div class=3D"bg-gray-50 border-l-4 border-purple-500=
 p-6"><h3 class=3D"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">JPEG XL</h3><p cl=
ass=3D"text-gray-700">The most technically capable modern format. Lossless =
JPEG transcoding, excellent quality-to-size ratio. Browser support is still=
 inconsistent=E2=80=94not ready as a default yet.</p></div><div class=3D"bg=
-gray-50 border-l-4 border-orange-500 p-6"><h3 class=3D"text-2xl font-bold =
text-gray-900 mb-4">PNG</h3><p class=3D"text-gray-700">Lossless only. Right=
 for logos, UI screenshots, and anything with hard edges or transparency th=
at would artifact under lossy compression. Wrong for photos.</p></div></div=
><h3 id=3D"when-to-use-each-format" class=3D"font-times text-2xl font-bold =
text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-16 mb-4">When to Use Each Format</h3><div c=
lass=3D"overflow-x-auto mb-12"><table class=3D"w-full text-sm border-collap=
se"><thead><tr class=3D"border-b-2 border-gray-200"><th class=3D"text-left =
